<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.3 </span>Text-to-Image Generation</h3>

<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report text-to-image generation results on the GenEval <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ghosh et al., 2023</a>)</cite> and DPG <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hu et al., 2024</a>)</cite> benchmarks, and FID scores on 30k prompts from MJHQ <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li et al., 2024b</a>)</cite> dataset. We compare against text-to-image models including Flux-dev <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Labs, 2024</a>)</cite>, SD3-Medium <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">Esser et al., 2024</a>)</cite>, Meissonic <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bai et al., 2024</a>)</cite> and DALLE-3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">OpenAI, 2023</a>)</cite>, unified models including BAGEL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">Deng et al., 2025</a>)</cite>, Show-o <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib68" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xie et al., 2024</a>)</cite>, MMaDa <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib69" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al., 2025</a>)</cite> and Muddit <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib57" title="" class="ltx_ref">Shi et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. Lavida-O significantly outperforms the state-of-the-art masked image generation model Meissonic, as well as unified models like MMaDa and Muddit. Planning and reflection further enhance prompt-following performance. We did not activate planning and reflection on MJHQ due to its large size and that FID does not reflect prompt-following capabilities.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
